# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Ironstack and MealStack moved from the Loadout to the Rack on Sept 13, 2026.
# Permanent: the MealStack app links to the old privacy URL in builds already
# installed. The splat rules cover trailing slashes.
#
# While MealStack 0.8.0 is in App Review, /loadout/mealstack/privacy is served
# by a shim page (src/pages/loadout/mealstack/privacy.astro), not redirected:
# Cloudflare evaluates these rules before static files, so the rules below
# name /loadout/mealstack and /loadout/mealstack/ explicitly instead of using
# a splat. After approval, delete the shim and replace the two MealStack rules
# with:  /loadout/mealstack/*   /rack/mealstack/:splat  301

/loadout/ironstack     /rack/ironstack         301
/loadout/ironstack/*   /rack/ironstack/:splat  301
/loadout/mealstack     /rack/mealstack         301
/loadout/mealstack/    /rack/mealstack         301
